OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith families still recovering from
OL,7,Fdevastating house fires, and major job
OL,8,Flosses announced in the region, some
OL,9,Fpositive success stories have still
OL,10,Fbeen happening across the West Midlands
OL,11,F` and we want to highlight them.
OL,13,FThis week, we have the tale of two mums
OL,14,Fwho created a safe space for children
OL,15,Fwith special needs, plus the giant
OL,16,Fpumpkin grower who is hoping to break
OL,17,Frecords.
OL,19,FTake a look at some of those news
OL,20,Fstories from across the region:
